# Testing Strategy

- Define tests **with** the feature design — not as an afterthought.
- Full matrix: `docs/testing-matrix.md`.

# By layer

| Layer | Required | Location |
|-------|----------|----------|
| Mobile domain | Unit test per use case | `mobile/composeApp/src/commonTest/` |
| Mobile presentation | Policy + ViewModel tests | `commonTest/.../viewmodel/` |
| Backend domain | Model invariants | `backend/domain/src/test/` |
| Backend application | Use case happy + failure (fake ports) | `backend/application/src/test/` |
| IA local | Benchmark scripts pass | `local/scripts/simulate_*.py` |

# Minimum per transactional feature

- Happy path and at least one failure path.
- Authorization: unauthenticated access rejected.
- Idempotency: repeated request with same key does not double-charge.
- Confirmation: no money movement without explicit user confirm in UI + backend validation.

# AI / chat scenarios

- Intent classification benchmarks on `eval_v1.jsonl`.
- Multi-turn policy on `dialogue_eval_v1.jsonl`.
- `unsafe_execution_count == 0` — classifier never triggers payment execution directly.

# Commands

```bash
cd backend && ./gradlew test
cd mobile && ./gradlew :composeApp:testDebugUnitTest
python3 local/scripts/simulate_intent_validation.py
```
